00:34:06.250 --> 00:34:12.450
I went to my hotel and I immediately sprained my ankle by stepping out onto my balcony, which was a two inch drop.

755
00:34:12.450 --> 00:34:17.270
And you're so athletic in your concerts, but it was like stepping on the balcony.

756
00:34:17.470 --> 00:34:18.330
Yes, that's what did it.

757
00:34:18.470 --> 00:34:26.050
And so I, the next day, started one of many, many shows in a row being filmed in 3D with a sprained ankle.

758
00:34:26.070 --> 00:34:27.070
And I was like, you know what?

759
00:34:27.170 --> 00:34:28.190
This gives me a challenge.

760
00:34:28.190 --> 00:34:29.090
I love a challenge.

761
00:34:29.330 --> 00:34:30.010
I'm going to do it.

762
00:34:30.090 --> 00:34:31.110
I'm going to, you know.

763
00:34:31.110 --> 00:34:44.630
And I think like really what the movie is about, aside from, you know, the fact that this tour and this show is so special for me and I want everyone to see it.

