00:34:44.630 --> 00:34:50.810
And the fact that the tour ended and not everyone in the entire world got to watch it is,

765
00:34:51.030 --> 00:34:58.270
I feel so grateful and lucky that people who didn't get to come are going to get to see it and feel like they were there.

766
00:34:58.430 --> 00:35:01.450
Also, people who did get to see it and want to relive it.

767
00:35:01.630 --> 00:35:09.850
And specifically, selfishly, that I will forever get to watch this and ask this.

768
00:35:09.850 --> 00:35:16.010
Yes, it's so special, I think, to have any kind of visual or oral history of something that meant a lot to you.

769
00:35:16.250 --> 00:35:18.130
And we have that with our podcaSt.

