812
00:38:02.830 --> 00:38:06.370
And that is such an amazing gift.

813
00:38:06.390 --> 00:38:16.590
And the amount of people that I think you sharing your health journey with, like, changed their lives and made them feel seen and, like, they're not alone.

814
00:38:16.590 --> 00:38:18.030
And that's just really special.

815
00:38:18.150 --> 00:38:19.150
And you don't have to do that.

816
00:38:19.350 --> 00:38:19.830
Yet, you do.

817
00:38:20.030 --> 00:38:25.230
And I think, like, that's obviously, like, completely a different thing than this stupid little movie I'm doing.

818
00:38:25.490 --> 00:38:25.710
Oh, no, no.

819
00:38:25.750 --> 00:38:27.350
But it just made me think of that.

820
00:38:27.450 --> 00:38:31.570
